// R5 lane PAR-MARGIN-2 (item 3 for a full-margin book): one 1x short (margin 100, 0.985 x equity)
// placed on the signal bar 2025-04-07 11:45 UTC, filled at the next bar's open and carried into a bar that
// first crosses the maintenance line at an early 1-minute high and reaches a higher high later.
// Magnifier OFF. Timeout close 3 bars after the entry bar.
//@version=6
strategy("pm2-i3-s1x-chart-0407-1145", overlay=true, initial_capital=1000,
     default_qty_type=strategy.fixed, default_qty_value=1, pyramiding=1,
     margin_long=100, margin_short=100, commission_value=0, slippage=0,
     process_orders_on_close=false)
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 7, 11, 45) and strategy.position_size == 0
    strategy.entry("S", strategy.short, qty = math.floor(0.985 * strategy.equity / close * 1000) / 1000)
if strategy.position_size < 0 and bar_index - strategy.opentrades.entry_bar_index(0) >= 3
    strategy.close("S", comment="timeout")
